      "writtenOn": "2023-04-20T13:36:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In addition, with current impl, package.odex in out/soong/.intermediates is anyway rebuilt whenever lunch target is changed because package.odex in out/soong/.intermediates\u0027 dependency to bootclasspath jars of which path contains \u003cproduct name\u003e is changed. So, I think this CL doesn\u0027t have regression on current behavior.",
      "parentUuid": "08ed891b_d1606b4b",
