      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T00:30:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, Colin. In practice, I believe switching across architectures is rarer than switching within the same architecture, especially in the CI environment. For example, we\u0027d like to build cf_x86_64_[phone|tablet|foldable] by the same build bot.\n\nWhen we switch across architectures (ex: Pixel and CF), there are many more factors that make it almost impossible to share artifacts. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "5745fe0d_4a3cf041",
      "revId": "4f67a809327a0de13e9249ce872721c1bd781cde",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
