      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T01:01:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do that a lot too, but isn\u0027t it the common expectation that the incremental build works very poor between the two, especially due to the slow rebuild of build.ninja?\n\nTo confirm this, I just built `framework-all` across aosp_arm64 and aosp_x86_64. Total 980 targets were rebuilt taking +5 min. I didn\u0027t look into that in detail, but it\u0027s probably because some java rules have some dependencies to the target name.",
      "parentUuid": "a4c253df_d463a30e",
      "revId": "4f67a809327a0de13e9249ce872721c1bd781cde",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
